### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- description: Raindrop.io bookmark and collection manager for a local Windows OpenClaw workspace. Use when the user wants to validate Raindrop auth, inspect their account, list or search bookmark collections, create/update/delete collections, save or edit bookmarks, bulk import/export bookmark links, or run local Raindrop.io OAuth flows without exposing secrets inside the published skill.
- Use the official Raindrop.io API through a local CLI that prefers Windows user environment variables and can optionally read a local `.env` file outside the skill folder.
- - store `RAINDROP_CLIENT_ID`, `RAINDROP_CLIENT_SECRET`, `RAINDROP_ACCESS_TOKEN`, and optional `RAINDROP_REFRESH_TOKEN` as Windows user environment variables
- python .\skills\raindrop-io-bookmark-manager\scripts\raindrop_manager.py export-bookmarks 123456 --format csv --output "C:\path\to\raindrop-export.csv"
- python .\skills\raindrop-io-bookmark-manager\scripts\raindrop_manager.py import-bookmarks --input "C:\path\to\urls.txt" --collection-id 123456 --output "C:\path\to\results.json"
